  ],
  "authority_note": "Core/workflow/catalog files in this package override conflicting question-authoring guidance in older combined toolkits; visual assets remain owned by the visual toolkit/course Framework. Structure/response/representation/tool fields are executable acceptance criteria, not descriptive metadata. Category labels never justify a task that does not fit the target. Metadata is descriptive/provenance support and never substitutes for the executable evidence-response-representation chain.",
